'''Peppermint''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Peppermint Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux during the pre-release of the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Peppermint is a knife with a candy cane pattern running down the middle and on the handle. It has chocolate-brown surrounding the candy cane pattern and the center of the knife resembling the buckle on a belt, like Father Christmas' belt. 

== Trivia ==
*This and [[Cookieblade]] replaced [[Prismatic]] in the [[shop]].
*It was purchasable along with [[Cookieblade]] during the event.
*Peppermint is one of the many candy cane themed weapons- the others being [[Lugercane]], [[Eternalcane]], [[Minty]], [[Candy]] and [[Sugar]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].

